<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV suspends trading in Algonodera.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV suspends trading in Algonodera.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish stock exchange watchdog CNMV said on Monday it has suspended trading in shares of Tavex Algonodera.</p>
<p>The CNMV said the decision was taken because of special circumstance that might affect the normal course of share dealing.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
